{"cue": "setup.starting_player.001.3", "q": "两人局。已经决定玩家A为起始玩家：把起始玩家标记从盒子里取出，放在玩家A面前的起始玩家标记区。这个状态变化是否合法？", "expect": null, "source": "content/games/splendor/tutorial/anim/v2/full.anim.json#setup.starting_player.001.3.qa[0]", "original_cue": "setup.starting_player.001.3", "sources": ["content/games/splendor/tutorial/anim/v2/full.anim.json#setup.starting_player.001.3.qa[0]"], "original_cues": ["setup.starting_player.001.3"], "reply": "合法，这是设置阶段的最后一步。规则里起始玩家标记本来就从盒子里取出、交给起始玩家放在他面前。要注意顺序是先随机选出起始玩家，再把这个标记给他。所以只要玩家A是随机选出来的，这个操作就完全正确。", "seconds": 3.8, "verdict": "合法"}
{"cue": "setup.nobles.001.2", "q": "璀璨宝石。两人局要摆几块贵族？我摆了 3 块。对吗？只回答「合法」或「有问题」，再给一句话理由。", "expect": null, "source": "content/games/splendor/tutorial/anim/_qa/questions.json#asks[2]", "original_cue": "setup.nobles.001.2", "sources": ["content/games/splendor/tutorial/anim/_qa/questions.json#asks[2]"], "original_cues": ["setup.nobles.001.2"], "reply": "合法。两人局的贵族是玩家数加一枚，也就是三块，你摆对了。", "seconds": 4.1, "verdict": "合法"}
{"cue": "setup.starting_player.001.3", "q": "璀璨宝石。起始玩家标记该怎么处理？我把它放到了玩家面前（起始玩家获得它）。对吗？只回答「合法」或「有问题」，再给一句话理由。", "expect": null, "source": "content/games/splendor/tutorial/anim/_qa/questions.json#asks[3]", "original_cue": "setup.starting_player.001.3", "sources": ["content/games/splendor/tutorial/anim/_qa/questions.json#asks[3]"], "original_cues": ["setup.starting_player.001.3"], "reply": "合法。设置时先随机选出起始玩家，再把起始玩家标记从游戏盒交到他面前，表示他最先行动。", "seconds": 3.4, "verdict": "合法"}
